{"result":"{
  "id": "18163",
  "key": "SFCC-102",
  "summary": "PDP – Slide Out - Size Guide",
  "description": "\\*\\*As a\\*\\* Shopper,\n\\*\\*I want\\*\\* to view a size guide on the product page without leaving my browsing session,\n\\*\\*so that\\*\\* I can find the right size before adding to bag.\n----\n\\*\\*Image for reference (Figma leading):\\*\\*\n![\"image-20260716-014145.png\"](image-20260716-014145.png)\nFor products where Measmerize is not configured, the Find My Size will not appear.\nThis story does not cover the Measmerize-powered size guide — see SFCC-101.\nFor extra information on the types of size guides - please check Confluence here: [04.4.4 Size Guides - Adobe SFCC - Confluence](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/SFCC/pages/383057926/04.4.4SizeGuides)",
  "status": {
    "name": "In Progress",
    "category": "In Progress",
    "color": "yellow"
  },
  "issue_type": {
    "name": "Story"
  },
  "priority": {
    "name": "High"
  },
  "assignee": {
    "display_name": "Jhoan Rose Dela Cruz",
    "name": "Jhoan Rose Dela Cruz",
    "email": "jhoan.rose.dela.cruz@accenture.com",
    "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:26b54c48-03dc-4b75-9a3b-4e924b0a4580/f69f9733-9221-48a9-aada-84ece49d3074/48"
  },
  "reporter": {
    "display_name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
    "name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
    "email": "jasmijn.tsang@accenture.com",
    "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d/40fcd533-06f6-4e5b-ba9f-23879e1193f9/48"
  },
  "labels": [
    "Contentful",
    "Custom",
    "PRD-053",
    "PRD-054",
    "PRD-055",
    "PRD-056",
    "PRD-057",
    "Squad-A"
  ],
  "created": "2026-07-06T14:58:41.662+1000",
  "updated": "2026-09-15T11:07:03.015+1000",
  "comments": [
    {
      "id": "13578",
      "body": "Asked Dani if there’s an existing product attribute for Size & Fit Description or if we need to create a new one.",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "email": "jasmijn.tsang@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d/40fcd533-06f6-4e5b-ba9f-23879e1193f9/48"
      },
      "created": "2026-07-29T14:48:17.616+1000",
      "updated": "2026-07-29T14:48:17.616+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "13592",
      "body": "Copy will be in SizeFit attribute, can contain text and bullet points.",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "email": "jasmijn.tsang@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d/40fcd533-06f6-4e5b-ba9f-23879e1193f9/48"
      },
      "created": "2026-07-30T17:04:54.487+1000",
      "updated": "2026-07-30T17:04:54.487+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "14072",
      "body": "Hi User:5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d - for products where Measmerise is not available, we will not display the Find Your Size link on the PDP as there is only one size to add to bag. If for some reason a clothing item does not have Measmerize enabled, then the Find Your Size link should not appear (which is what the current website does).",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Dani Rivett",
        "name": "Dani Rivett",
        "email": null,
        "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/42d3d7910c25b8f4ba9e46aabfc6c149?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FDR-3.png"
      },
      "created": "2026-08-28T09:12:26.499+1000",
      "updated": "2026-08-28T09:12:26.499+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "14074",
      "body": "User:712020:4ec4770e-9470-4885-9753-69a36b6cf950 Noted, I updated the description of the user story to reflect that: For products where Measmerize is not configured, the Find My Size will not appear.",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "email": "jasmijn.tsang@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d/40fcd533-06f6-4e5b-ba9f-23879e1193f9/48"
      },
      "created": "2026-08-28T11:08:59.561+1000",
      "updated": "2026-08-28T11:08:59.561+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "14411",
      "body": "User:623a4c25562ab90069f7e510 provided the updated Figma link [here](https://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann\\*Design\\*System\\_2026?node-id=40001889-38495&t=wd17WLalltMLSYkN-1)",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Hazel Marie Cacalda",
        "name": "Hazel Marie Cacalda",
        "email": "hazel.marie.i.banaz@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/883ff1fae0c6179bdff495757469823d?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FHC-4.png"
      },
      "created": "2026-09-07T11:51:30.752+1000",
      "updated": "2026-09-07T11:51:30.752+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "14472",
      "body": "User:623a4c25562ab90069f7e510 the mobile design for this can be scrolled horizontally? Is this the expected behavior?",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Hazel Marie Cacalda",
        "name": "Hazel Marie Cacalda",
        "email": "hazel.marie.i.banaz@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/883ff1fae0c6179bdff495757469823d?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FHC-4.png"
      },
      "created": "2026-09-07T19:55:27.046+1000",
      "updated": "2026-09-07T19:55:27.046+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "14473",
      "body": "User:5f506d223e9e2e004d7c48ac Yep! If the information can’t fit within the breakpoint, the details will scroll horizontally, with a white shadow as shown [here](https://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann*Design*System*2026?node-id=40002046-29456&t=3uSBusOWDkiH9T3f-1) in the templates file. Minimum width of 64px on cells has also been added to accommodate the scenario the cells have decimals as seen in the comp [here](https://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann*Design*System*2026?node-id=40001903-42437&t=3uSBusOWDkiH9T3f-1)",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Kiera Rikard-Bell",
        "name": "Kiera Rikard-Bell",
        "email": "kiera.rikard-bell@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f5a85438e9e7b1d7bdfd0f2eb22a4b4e?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FKR-1.png"
      },
      "created": "2026-09-07T20:00:33.183+1000",
      "updated": "2026-09-07T20:00:33.183+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "14532",
      "body": "Understood from User:623a4c25562ab90069f7e510 that final wording is Size & Fit → Size Guide. I have updated the user story User:5f506d223e9e2e004d7c48ac User:712020:4ec4770e-9470-4885-9753-69a36b6cf950",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "email": "jasmijn.tsang@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d/40fcd533-06f6-4e5b-ba9f-23879e1193f9/48"
      },
      "created": "2026-09-09T13:57:55.585+1000",
      "updated": "2026-09-09T13:57:55.585+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "14685",
      "body": "As discussed with User:5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d , default unit of measurement will depend on storefront which will be covered on [SFCC-674](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-674)  when we apply the locales.\n\nUS International / US Domestic - default is Inch\n\nOther storefronts - default is CM\n\n\nFYI User:712020:26b54c48-03dc-4b75-9a3b-4e924b0a4580",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Hazel Marie Cacalda",
        "name": "Hazel Marie Cacalda",
        "email": "hazel.marie.i.banaz@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/883ff1fae0c6179bdff495757469823d?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FHC-4.png"
      },
      "created": "2026-09-14T20:08:29.759+1000",
      "updated": "2026-09-14T20:36:32.837+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "14704",
      "body": "Hi User:557058:1a7fb05a-783b-4241-a0f1-9a7b046da3a8 User:712020:08a6f120-c836-4f71-92db-c97999401c49 User:712020:720f383b-6a35-4ede-b15e-0e90cf7e8d70 this card is now ready for review\n\nPR: [https://github.com/ZimmermannAU/zimmermann-pwa/pull/114](https://github.com/ZimmermannAU/zimmermann-pwa/pull/114)",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Jhoan Rose Dela Cruz",
        "name": "Jhoan Rose Dela Cruz",
        "email": "jhoan.rose.dela.cruz@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:26b54c48-03dc-4b75-9a3b-4e924b0a4580/f69f9733-9221-48a9-aada-84ece49d3074/48"
      },
      "created": "2026-09-15T03:24:29.465+1000",
      "updated": "2026-09-15T03:24:29.465+1000"
    }
  ]
}"}

