{"result":"{
  "id": "18160",
  "key": "SFCC-101",
  "summary": "PDP – Slide out - Measmerize Widget & Find My Size CTA",
  "description": "**As a** Shopper,\n\n**I want** to find my recommended size on the product page,\n\n**so that** I can select the right size with confidence before adding to bag.\n\n----\n\n**Image for reference (Figma is leading):** \n\n![\"image-20260819-012358.png\"](image-20260819-012358.png)\n\n*Please note - the new design of Measmerize is not in our control - Measmerize is responsible for the look and feel within the widget.*\n\n**Image of current widget for reference, in case new design is not yet picked up by Measmerize:**\n\n![\"image-20260716-012029.png\"](image-20260716-012029.png)\n\nThe PDP displays a Find My Size CTA when Measmerize is configured for the product. When Measmerize is not configured for the product, the link will simply not appear, and the shopper can go to the Size & Fit link below.",
  "status": {
    "name": "In Progress",
    "category": "In Progress",
    "color": "yellow"
  },
  "issue_type": {
    "name": "Story"
  },
  "priority": {
    "name": "High"
  },
  "assignee": {
    "display_name": "Jhoan Rose Dela Cruz",
    "name": "Jhoan Rose Dela Cruz",
    "email": "jhoan.rose.dela.cruz@accenture.com",
    "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:26b54c48-03dc-4b75-9a3b-4e924b0a4580/f69f9733-9221-48a9-aada-84ece49d3074/48"
  },
  "reporter": {
    "display_name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
    "name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
    "email": "jasmijn.tsang@accenture.com",
    "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d/40fcd533-06f6-4e5b-ba9f-23879e1193f9/48"
  },
  "labels": [
    "Custom",
    "Measmerize",
    "PRD-021",
    "PRD-050",
    "PRD-053",
    "Squad-A"
  ],
  "created": "2026-07-06T14:25:57.655+1000",
  "updated": "2026-09-15T14:08:32.943+1000",
  "comments": [
    {
      "id": "13979",
      "body": "Hi User:5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d \n\nPlease see my comments below, if anything is unclear lets discuss during the story review session.\n\n1. Within the description it is stated that Find my size is listed on every PDP - this is incorrect as we do not send all rpoduct data to Measmerize, for example Men board shorts, Kids and accessories (excl. belts and maybe gloves) are categories that we do not send data to Measmerize for so the CTA will not be visible for those products. \n  1. This is managed by Measmerize so its more of an FYI for build but may be important for testing.\n1. AC 3 to be discussed `2026-08-25`\n1. AC 5 - this visual update is managed by Measmerize\n1. This there a different ticket that covers the Size selector component and the various states?\n\nThe assumption is correct\n\nDependency for UAT - we may need to load new product data into measmerize staging as it is likely out of date and may not align to the products available in SFCC. User:712020:2b2b9bc1-bb30-4242-be23-ad0ed190badc please capture this as an action",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Emma Kirwan",
        "name": "Emma Kirwan",
        "email": null,
        "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/437c30dd63bbb0ec0a2f7c0d8d556d93?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FEK-4.png"
      },
      "created": "2026-08-24T19:06:17.796+1000",
      "updated": "2026-08-24T19:06:17.796+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "14007",
      "body": "User:712020:c99d37b3-9c93-4347-951d-5ffb32ff1341 I had created size selector as its own component user story but was advised to keep it as a part of this component [SFCC-737 pdp/product-content - Jira](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-737) - so in there its treated as an atom of the product-content component in AC9:\n\n\n1. Given the component renders, then the size selector displays per the design system spec — refer to Figma for all rendering states. The size selector must handle the following states passed in as props: default (no selection), filled (size selected), in-stock, low stock, out of stock, notify me, recommended, error, and one-size. Given the product is one-size, then the standard selector is suppressed and a plain \"One size\" label renders in its place and is treated as pre-selected.",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "email": "jasmijn.tsang@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d/40fcd533-06f6-4e5b-ba9f-23879e1193f9/48"
      },
      "created": "2026-08-25T09:40:21.491+1000",
      "updated": "2026-08-25T09:40:21.491+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "14075",
      "body": "User:712020:c99d37b3-9c93-4347-951d-5ffb32ff1341 Updated this ticket after Dani’s response on [SFCC-101](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-101) - we will not show the Find My Size if Measmerize is not configured for the product.\nHere are the changes I made:\n\\*\\*AC1.\\*\\*\nGiven a shopper is on a PDP, when the page loads, then the Find My Size CTA is displayed next to the size selector when Measmerize is configured for that product.\n\\*\\*AC3.\\*\\*\nGiven a shopper is on a PDP where Measmerize is not configured for the product, when the shopper clicks Find My Size, then the SFCC size guide slide-out opens instead (if [SFCC-102](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-102) is not built, then it should just not return any result).\n->\nGiven a shopper is on a PDP where Measmerize is not configured for the product, then Find My Size does not appear and the shopper can navigate to the Size & Fit guide instead (if [SFCC-102](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-102) is not built, then it should just not return any result).\n\\*\\*AC5.\\*\\*\nGiven the Measmerize widget has generated a size recommendation for the shopper, when the shopper views the size selector, then the Find your size CTA has been replaced by the word “Recommended: <>\\*\\*”, so for size 0P that would be “Recommended: 0P\\*\\*” (Managed by Measmerize, if not yet built, we would have to test this AC at a later stage)",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "email": "jasmijn.tsang@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d/40fcd533-06f6-4e5b-ba9f-23879e1193f9/48"
      },
      "created": "2026-08-28T11:23:18.139+1000",
      "updated": "2026-08-28T11:23:18.139+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "14165",
      "body": "User:712020:08a6f120-c836-4f71-92db-c97999401c49 to confirm if Measmerize script is now loaded to start working on this story.",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Hazel Marie Cacalda",
        "name": "Hazel Marie Cacalda",
        "email": "hazel.marie.i.banaz@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/883ff1fae0c6179bdff495757469823d?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FHC-4.png"
      },
      "created": "2026-09-01T12:50:53.698+1000",
      "updated": "2026-09-01T12:50:53.698+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "14413",
      "body": "User:623a4c25562ab90069f7e510  confirmed that then final approved design is [here](https://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann*Design*System_2026?node-id=40001889-38502&t=wd17WLalltMLSYkN-1)",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Hazel Marie Cacalda",
        "name": "Hazel Marie Cacalda",
        "email": "hazel.marie.i.banaz@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/883ff1fae0c6179bdff495757469823d?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FHC-4.png"
      },
      "created": "2026-09-07T11:53:09.772+1000",
      "updated": "2026-09-07T11:53:09.772+1000"
    }
  ]
}"}

